      "amount": "chopped (for garnish)"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "dehydrate the morcilla links in a food dehydrator at 135f for 4 hours, or in a low oven (150f) for 6 hours.",
    "heat the coconut oil in a hot stone plate over medium-high heat.",
    "add the sliced onion and cook until caramelized, stirring occasionally.",
    "add the minced ginger and garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the cumin seeds and cook for another minute.",
    "add the coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder. cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the dehydrated morcilla links and cook for 2-3 minutes, until heated through.",
    "season with salt to taste.",
    "garnish with chopped cilantro and serve immediately.",
    "serve with basmati rice or roti, if desired."
  ],
